('42', '', '𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟒 𝐈𝐂𝐌𝐀𝐑', 'ICMARs-2024', '<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/public_files/images/icmar-2024.jpg\" class=\"img img-responsive\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br>\r\nThe Visayas Mindanao Consortium Journal Publication Inc. is excited to announce its annual International Conference on Methodological Advances in Research (ICMAR), taking place from September 17-20, 2024. This event, hosted by North Eastern Mindanao State University, revolves around the theme \"From Insight to Action: Achieving the Sustainable Development Goals through Methodological Advances in Research.\"\r\n<br><br>\r\n𝗖𝗢𝗡𝗙𝗘𝗥𝗘𝗡𝗖𝗘 𝗦𝗧𝗥𝗔𝗡𝗗𝗦<br><br>\r\n📍Methodological Innovations in Data Analytics\r\n<br>\r\n📍Qualitative Methodologies for Social Impact\r\n<br>\r\n📍Interdisciplinary Research for Holistic Solutions\r\n<br>\r\n📍Strategic Planning and Policy Development\r\n<br>\r\n📍Implementation Science and Real-world Impact\r\n<br>\r\n📍Community Engagement and Empowerment\r\n<br>\r\n📍Metrics and Assessment Frameworks\r\n<br>\r\n📍Global and Local Partnerships\r\n<br><br>\r\n𝗜𝗠𝗣𝗢𝗥𝗧𝗔𝗡𝗧 𝗗𝗔𝗧𝗘𝗦:\r\n<br><br>\r\n📍August 1, 2024 – Deadline of the 250 words abstract\r\n<br>\r\n📍August 8, 2024 – Notification of Abstract Acceptance\r\n<br>\r\n📍August 15, 2024 – Deadline of Full Paper Submission and Pre-recorded Video Presentation\r\n<br><br>\r\n𝗥𝗘𝗚𝗜𝗦𝗧𝗥𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡 𝗙𝗘𝗘\r\n<br><br>\r\n📍For onsite participants:<br>\r\n          Php 6,000.00  National <br>\r\n          USD   200.00  International <br>\r\n📍For virtual participants:<br>\r\n         Php   3,000.00  National<br>\r\n         USD 100.00  International\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\nWe warmly invite you to join us for this enriching experience. \r\nConfirm your attendance and submit your papers at \r\n<u><a href=\"https://forms.gle/eJtdr7FvBrHpLLDQ8\" target=\"_blank\"><b>https://forms.gle/eJtdr7FvBrHpLLDQ8</b></a></u>\r\n<br>\r\nFor further inquiries, please email icmar@nemsu.edu.ph\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'North Eastern Mindanao State University - Tandag Campus', '2024-09-17 08:00:00', '2024-09-20 17:00:00', 1, 1, '2024-05-17 08:12:28', '2024-05-17 08:12:28'),
('43', '', '𝐄𝐍𝐑𝐎𝐋𝐋𝐌𝐄𝐍𝐓 𝐀𝐍𝐍𝐎𝐔𝐍𝐂𝐄𝐌𝐄𝐍𝐓:', 'Enrollment-Announcement-2024', '<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/public_files/images/enrollment-2024.jpg\" class=\"img img-responsive\" /></p><br>\r\n𝐄𝐍𝐑𝐎𝐋𝐋𝐌𝐄𝐍𝐓 𝐀𝐍𝐍𝐎𝐔𝐍𝐂𝐄𝐌𝐄𝐍𝐓:\r\n<br>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br>\r\n\r\nThe North Eastern Mindanao State University is pleased to announce that the enrolment schedule for the Academic Year 2024-2025 will commence on July 15, 2024. We encourage all students to complete their enrolment within this period to ensure a smooth start to the academic year.\r\n<br><br>\r\n𝑾𝒂𝒍𝒌 𝒂 𝒋𝒐𝒖𝒓𝒏𝒆𝒚 𝒘𝒊𝒕𝒉 𝒆𝒙𝒄𝒆𝒍𝒍𝒆𝒏𝒄𝒆 𝒂𝒕 𝑵𝑬𝑴𝑺𝑼!\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'North Eastern Mindanao State University - Tandag Campus', '2024-07-15 17:50:00', '2024-08-10 17:50:00', 1, 1, '2024-07-05 17:50:00', '2024-07-05 17:50:00'),
('987727b0-c5e1-4170-8efd-b13b1ff42ee1', '', '𝐒𝐓𝐔𝐃𝐄𝐍𝐓𝐒 𝐁𝐔𝐒𝐈𝐍𝐄𝐒𝐒 𝐂𝐎𝐍𝐆𝐑𝐄𝐒𝐒 𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟒', 'Students-business-congress-2024', '<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/public_files/images/Bizcon.jpg\" class=\"img img-responsive\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br><b>\r\nTheme: \"Inspire, Integrate, Innovate: Strategies for Achieving Success\"</b>\r\n<br>\r\nWe are thrilled to invite you to an inspiring day filled with insightful talks and networking opportunities at the Business Congress 2024 to be held at NEMSU Gymnasium 8:00am-onwards. We have an exciting lineup of sessions designed to empower and equip you with the tools to thrive in your career and entrepreneurial endeavors.\r\n<br><br>\r\nSession 1:<br>\r\nTopic: “Personality Development as Preparation on How to Find Work, Get Hired, and Become an Effective Employee”<br>\r\nGuest Speaker: Mr. Romel M. Oribe, CSEE\r\n<br><br>\r\nSession 2:<br>\r\nTopic: “Personal Experiences and Preparations to Succeed”<br>\r\nGuest Speaker: Ms. April Grace Tolentino-Minion\r\n<br><br>\r\nSession 3:<br>\r\nTopic: “Personality Development as Preparation to Become an Entrepreneur”<br>\r\nGuest Speaker: Mr. Bonipart Prado Salinas\r\n<br><br>\r\nDo not miss this opportunity to connect with industry leaders, gain valuable knowledge, and be inspired to achieve success in your professional journey. See you there!!\r\n<br><br>\r\n#BusinessCongress2024\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'NEMSU Gymnasium - Tandag Campus', '2024-05-23 08:00:00', '2024-05-23 17:00:00', 1, 1, '2024-05-20 17:00:00', '2024-05-20 17:00:00'),
('987727b0-c5e1-4170-8efd-b13b1ff42ee5', NULL, 'ESGP-PA Career Guidance Seminar', 'esgp-pa-career-guidance-seminar', NULL, 'Audio Visual Center, Surigao Del Sur State University', '2017-08-23 09:00:00', '2017-08-23 09:00:00', 0, 0, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-c5e1-4170-8efd-b13b1ff42ee6', '', '𝗕𝗦𝗙𝗶 𝗵𝗼𝘀𝘁𝘀 𝟮𝗻𝗱 𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗱𝘂𝗰𝘁 𝗘𝘅𝗽𝗼 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗣𝗶𝘁𝗰𝗵𝗶𝗻𝗴, 𝘀𝗵𝗼𝘄𝗰𝗮𝘀𝗲𝘀 𝗶𝗻𝗻𝗼𝘃𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻𝘀 𝗼𝗳 𝗳𝗶𝘀𝗵𝗲𝗿𝗶𝗲𝘀 𝘀𝘁𝘂𝗱𝘀', 'Product-Expo-2024', '<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/public_files/images/product-expo-2024.jpg\" class=\"img img-responsive\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br><b>\r\nThe Bachelor of Science in Fisheries (BSFi) program of North Eastern Mindanao State University-Lianga held its 2nd Product Expo and Pitching on Friday, May 17, 2024 at the NEMSU Brackishwater Fish Farm.\r\n<br><br>\r\nThe event welcomed esteemed guests including 1st District Representative Congressman Romeo S. Momo Sr., Campus Director Mdm. Catherine F. Salomon, Dean of Forestry, Agriculture and Aquatic Sciences Dr. Clemencia Sumagaysay, Office of the Student Welfare and Development (OSWD) Head Dr. Ivy Orcullo, Department Chair Dr. Fabio Ruaza, BSFi Program Chair Henrietta Sanchez, and faculty from the Department of Fisheries and Marine Sciences (DFiMES).\r\n<br><br>\r\nIn his message, Congressman Momo complimented the students and the faculty for this undertaking.\r\n<br><br>\r\n\"I commend the students for their dedication and the faculty for unwavering support in nurturing these young and brilliant minds,\" he expressed.\r\nMao ni ang gikinahanglan nato, ang mga estudyante na naay passion actually, to serve, to help, and to produce more,\" he added.\r\n<br><br>\r\nBuilding on his visits to other NEMSU campuses, he expressed his hope to assist the campus with the infrastructure it needs and mentioned the possibility of showcasing the research-based products at the Surigao del Sur Provincial Capitol.\r\nThe expo featured a variety of innovative aquatic-themed products developed by third-year students, including the Seafood Black Pasta, Tuna Pastil, Tuna Churros, Seaweed Pasta, Scallops Dumpling, Tuna Cupcake, Tunayaki, Seaweed Tuna Shawarma, Seaweed Pizza, Tuna Chips, Tuna Viscera Siomai, and Seaweed Tea.\r\n<br><br>\r\nThe fourth-year students also displayed four innovative research-based products: Seaweed Boat Tart, Dark Chocolate Tuna, Seaweed Lumpia Wrapper, and Seaweed Leche Flan.\r\n<br><br>\r\nAdditionally, a pitching competition capped off the event, allowing students to showcase their products and gain valuable feedback from a distinguished panel of judges: Rhea J. Santos, Food Technologist from the Department of Science and Technology (DOST), Paterno Silla, Jr., and Ms. Merlyn Dela Peña, both fisheries technologist processing majors, and Prof. Amor Rojas-Salinas, Chair of the Marine Biology program.\r\n<br><br>\r\nFollowing the verdict, an awards ceremony recognized the outstanding products, where Seaweed Tea was declared the first place, followed by Tuna Chips in second place, while Scallops Dumpling secured third place and received the Best in Pitching award.\r\n<br><br>\r\nMeanwhile, Seaweed Tuna Shawarma and Seafood Black Pasta both received consolation prizes.\r\n<br><br>\r\nOrganized by the BSFi Faculty Ms. Dian Dumbase, the event served as a testament to the commitment of the BSFi in fostering innovation and practical solutions for sustainability in the field of fisheries. | Report by Kaye Ann L. Quezada \r\n<br>\r\nPhotos by Jeszyrus Plaza and Mike Guarino\r\n<br><br>\r\n#TheSeaStrivers <br>\r\n#SailingAndStrivingForTheTruth <br>\r\n#NEMSULiangaCampus\r\n\r\n', 'University Brackish Water Fish Farm, Purok-1, Poblacion, Lianga, SDS', '2024-05-17 08:00:00', '2024-05-17 17:00:00', 1, 1, '2024-05-16 17:00:00', '2024-05-16 17:00:00'),
('987727b0-cd3a-4ea0-890b-da7fdd6a6e2e', NULL, 'The Ultimate Guide to College', 'the-ultimate-guide-to-college', NULL, 'Prospero B. Pichay Sr. Gymnasium, Surigao Del Sur State University', '2017-08-23 09:00:00', '2017-08-23 09:00:00', 0, 0, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-ce1f-4d02-bfca-e8f8b6bf335e', NULL, 'Orientation on Research Ethics and Organization of the Committee (Establishment of the University Research Ethics Phase I)', 'orientation-on-research-ethics-and-organization-of-the-committee-establishment-of-the-university-research-ethics-phase-i', '<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Ethics requirement for research has become a mandatory aspect as mandated by CHED, DOST, DSWD, and other funding agencies. Since SDSSU is research-oriented academic system, there is a need to adhere to this mandate. Likewise, most journal publications also require ethical approval before the acceptance of the paper publication.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">In order to be oriented about research ethics, you are introduced to send ten (10) participants per campus (including the R&amp;D Heads) to the Orientation Activity on July 30-31, 2018, 8:00 A.M &ndash; 5:00 P.M. at SDSSU Main Campus. Preferred participants are those senior faculty who are doing or will be conducting research.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Lunch and snacks will be served during the activity. Accommodation and other traveling expenses will be charged to <strong>GAA </strong>Research Funds of the University Subject to the usual accounting and auditing procedures.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">For compliance.</span></span></p>', 'SDSSU Main Campus', '2018-07-30 08:00:00', '2018-07-31 17:00:00', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-cef7-4c1b-adb8-302dd2e798c5', NULL, 'Trainings on IM\'s Preparation', 'trainings-on-ims-preparation', NULL, 'Old Library, Surigao Del Sur State University-Main Campus', '2018-08-23 08:00:00', '2018-08-25 17:00:00', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-cfa9-481b-b981-f025b1cad8cf', NULL, 'QMS 106: Root Cause Analysis and Management Review', 'qms-106-root-cause-analysis-and-management-review', NULL, 'Old Library, Surigao Del Sur State University', '2018-10-26 08:00:00', '2018-10-29 21:00:00', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-d07f-4870-9db3-9eaf7b61c230', NULL, '2021 AACCUP Online Program Accreditation', '2021-aaccup-online-program-accreditation', '<p><span style=\"color:#c0392b\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">August 23-27, 2021 | TANDAG CAMPUS</span></span></strong></span></p>\n          \n          <p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Seven (7) programs will be accredited in the main campus in Tandag City namely:</span></span></p>\n          \n          <ul>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">BS in Business Administration Major in Human Resource Development Management</span></span></strong></li>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">BEED Major in Pre-School Education</span></span></strong></li>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Ph.D in Science Education</span></span></strong></li>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Ph.D in Mathematics</span></span></strong></li>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Master of Science in Computer Science</span></span></strong></li>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">AB in Filipino</span></span></strong></li>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">BS in Environmental Science</span></span></strong></li>\n          </ul>\n          \n          <hr />\n          <p><span style=\"color:#c0392b\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">September 13-17, 2021 | LIANGA CAMPUS</span></span></strong></span></p>\n          \n          <p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">One (1) program will be accredited in the Lianga Campus namely:</span></span></p>\n          \n          <ul>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Bachelor of Science in Computer Science</span></span></strong></li>\n          </ul>\n          \n          <hr />\n          <p><span style=\"color:#c0392b\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">September 13-17, 2021 | TAGBINA CAMPUS</span></span></strong></span></p>\n          \n          <p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">One (1) program will be accredited in the Tagbina Campus namely:</span></span></p>\n          \n          <ul>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Bachelor of Science in Hotel and Restaurant Management</span></span></strong></li>\n          </ul>\n          \n          <hr />\n          <p><span style=\"color:#c0392b\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">September 13-17, 2021 | CAGWAIT CAMPUS</span></span></strong></span></p>\n          \n          <p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">One (1) program will be accredited in the Cagwait Campus namely:</span></span></p>\n          \n          <ul>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Bachelor of Science in Hotel and Restaurant Management</span></span></strong></li>\n          </ul>\n          \n          <hr />\n          <p><span style=\"color:#c0392b\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">September 13-17, 2021 | SAN MIGUEL CAMPUS</span></span></strong></span></p>\n          \n          <p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Two (2) programs will be accredited in the San Miguel Campus namely:</span></span></p>\n          \n          <ul>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Bachelor of Science in Agriculture Major in Crop Science</span></span></strong></li>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Bachelor of Science in Agricultural Technology Major in Technology, Meat &amp; Vegetable Processing and Farm Mechanization</span></span></strong></li>\n          </ul>\n          \n          <hr />\n          <p><span style=\"color:#c0392b\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">September 27-October 1, 2021 | BISLIG CAMPUS</span></span></strong></span></p>\n          \n          <p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Five (5) programs will be accredited in the San Miguel Campus namely:</span></span></p>\n          \n          <ul>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Bachelor of Secondary Education Major in English</span></span></strong></li>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Bachelor of Science in Civil Engineering</span></span></strong></li>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Bachelor of Science in Electrical Engineering</span></span></strong></li>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Bachelor of Science in Forestry</span></span></strong></li>\n              <li><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Bachelor of Science in Mechanical Engineering</span></span></strong></li>\n          </ul>', 'SURIGAO DEL SUR STATE UNIVERSITY', '2021-08-23 08:00:00', '2021-10-01 17:00:00', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-d178-47d2-a35f-06199c51af45', NULL, 'Research Manual Finalization', 'research-manual-finalization', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; In the exigency of service and to be able to perform the mandates of the Research Unit of the University being one of its vital core functions, you are directed to huddle for the <strong>finalization of the Research Manual </strong>on <strong>August 18-19, 2021</strong> and <strong>September 3,6 and 7, 2021</strong>.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Meals, Snacks, and all other expenses incurred regarding this activity shall be charged to the University Fund subject to the usual accounting and auditing rules and regulations.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; For you guidance and compliance.</span></span></p>', 'SURIGAO DEL SUR STATE UNIVERSITY', '2021-08-18 08:00:00', '2021-08-19 17:00:00', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-d235-4e61-a9ef-1eb75e82edd8', NULL, 'Research Manual Finalization', 'research-manual-finalization', '<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; In the exigency of service and to be able to perform the mandates of the Research Unit of the University being one of its vital core functions, you are directed to huddle for the<strong> University Research Council (URC)</strong> Meeting on <strong>August 31, 2021</strong> to evalaute research proposals aligned to our Research Platforms and Agenda that could warant for Univrsity support.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Meals, Snacks, and all other expenses incurred regarding this activity shall be charged to the University Fund subject to the usual accounting and auditing rules and regulations.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; For you guidance and compliance.</span></span></p>', 'SURIGAO DEL SUR STATE UNIVERSITY', '2021-08-31 00:00:00', '2021-08-31 00:00:00', 1, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-d312-4e71-b9d9-b995ca7498bf', NULL, 'Culminating Activities of the 54th Asean Founding Anniversary Celebreation', 'culminating-activities-of-the-54th-asean-founding-anniversary-celebreation', '<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The culminating activity of the CHED Caraga 54th ASEAN Founding Anniversary with the theme<em><strong> &quot;Moving Forward, Claiming Victory for Philippine Higher Education PHE in the ASEAN Community&quot;</strong></em> will be conducted on August 27, 2021, Friday at 9:00 AM.</span></span></p>', 'Via zoom platforms', '2021-08-27 09:00:00', '2021-08-27 17:00:00', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-d3ee-4fca-a8d3-7300122e1ae0', NULL, '121st Philippine Civil Service Anniversary Celebration', '121st-philippine-civil-service-anniversary-celebration', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; In the Compliance with the Mandate of 121st Philippine Civil Service Anniversary celebration, with the theme; <strong>&quot;TRANSFORMING PUBLIC SERVICE IN THE NEXT DECADE HONING AGILE AND FUTURE READY SERVANT HEROES&quot;</strong>, the University hereby joins in celebrating with the following activities, to wit;</span></span></p>\n          \n          <ol>\n              <li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">September 1, 2021 - Hanging in the facade of the 121st PSCA Official Banner</span></span></li>\n              <li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">September 6, 2021 - 7:45am, Simultaneous Flag Raising, Renewal of OATH, Awit ng Serbisyo Sibil (<em><strong>NOTE: wear Filipiniana inspired attire/barong</strong></em>) all campuses</span></span></li>\n              <li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">September 8-10, 2021 - CSC Prime HRM Pre-assessment and Review</span></span></li>\n              <li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">September 16, 2021 - Oath Taking Ceremony and Orientation of the Newly Appointed Instructor I</span></span></li>\n              <li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">September 20, 2021 - Flag Raising Ceremony/Inter-Agencies celebration synchronized with CSC Regional Office (wear prescribed Monday Uniform)</span></span></li>\n              <li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">September 30, 2021 - SDSSU Family Day</span></span></li>\n          </ol>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The simultaneous activity on September 6, 2021 will be conducted face to face blended with virtual platform via zoom, the Main Campus (Tandag) as Virtual Host will provide the zoom link. This event should be participated by the key officials; VPAF, VPAA, Campus Directors, Deans, Directors, all Office Heads and all faculty and staff.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; All expenses incurred during these activities will be charged to each campus respectively, subbject to the usual accounting and auditing rules and regulations.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; For guidance and compliance.</span></span></p>', 'SURIGAO DEL SUR STATE UNIVERSITY', '2021-09-01 08:00:00', '2021-08-31 17:00:00', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-dae4-41a5-87e3-359540af207f', NULL, 'Three (3) Day Mentoring Workshop on Prime HRM CSC accreditation', 'three-3-day-mentoring-workshop-on-prime-hrm-csc-accreditation', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; This is to inform you that a 3 Day Mentoring Workshop Seminar on readiness for Enhanced CSC Prime HRM Accreditation is scheduled on September 8,9,10, 2021 thus, you are hereby directed to attend the same. This mentoring-workshop will assess the maturity level of the agency&#39;s competencies, system, and practices in four HR systems, viz; Recruitement Selection, Strategic Perfomance Management System, Learning and Development and Reward and Recognition.</span></span></p>', 'Horizon Bay Resort - Magallanes, Agusan Del Norte', '2021-09-08 08:00:00', '2021-09-10 17:00:00', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-dc46-4b39-9eeb-160fef12d649', NULL, 'OBSERVANCE OF A STRICTLY NO-FACE-TO-FACE GATHERINGS', 'observance-of-a-strictly-no-face-to-face-gatherings', '<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Due to the reported surge of cases in the various municipalities, and the presence of the DELTA variant in CARAGA as reported by DOH, this Office instructs all academic and administrative units to refrain from conducting face to face meetings/gathering. All official huddles shall make use of the online modality to avoid virus transmission.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Meanwhile, you are also directed to remind the academic community and personnel under your supervision to stringently observe the health protocols in the work place to minimize if not stop the adverse effect of the pandemic that has put us all in a vulnerable situation</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The same instruction is to be cascaded to our student; hence who are distributing modules shall also ensure that our students will not be exposed to CIVID 19 susceptibility any physical. Further, for our student&rsquo;s safety, they shall be reminded to refrain from conducting any physical gathering while we are still confronted with this pandemic</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; This directive shall take effect immediately until further advices.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; For strict implementation and compliance.</span></span></p>', 'SURIGAO DEL SUR STATE UNIVERSITY', '2021-09-14 08:00:00', '2021-09-30 17:00:00', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-ddbb-4ec1-90c1-3a375b9023c4', NULL, 'CONDUCT OF EVALUATION FOR NBC 461 CYCLES 8 AND 9 FOR ENDORSEMENT TO PASUC', 'conduct-of-evaluation-for-nbc-461-cycles-8-and-9-for-endorsement-to-pasuc', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Per information from PASUC during the 2nd Executive Board Meeting held via ZOOM, we are to submit our budget for the faculty promotion based on NBC 461 to PASUC on September17, 2021, Due to urgency of the information, Campus Directors are instructed to initiate a per campus evaluation; results of which will be submitted to Ms. Kim Dahan-Estrada on September 16, 2021 at 2:00 pm for consolidation.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; For information and compliance</span></span></p>', 'Zoom | Via Virtual platforms', '2021-09-17 00:00:00', '2021-09-17 00:00:00', 1, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-defc-494b-a227-7705adf9717a', NULL, '3rd QUARTER EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE MEETING', '3rd-quarter-executive-committee-meeting', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; This is to inform that the 3rd Quarter Executive Committee Meeting is scheduled on September 22, 2021 at 9:00 in the morning through virtual platform (zoom).</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Participants of the said meeting are the VPAF, VPAA, Campus Directors, Deans, Directors, Board Secretary V,&nbsp; Budget Officer III, Planning Officer III, HRMO, Accountant III, Procurement Officer, Executive Assistant and other key Officials.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Expenses incurred in this meeting to cover meals and snacks shall be funded from the general fund of the whole University subject to the usual accounting and auditing rules and regulations.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; For information and strict compliance.</span></span></p>', 'Zoom | Via Virtual platforms', '2021-09-22 09:00:00', '2021-09-22 17:00:00', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-dff4-4192-8956-12af4c94d376', NULL, '3rd QUARTER TARGET FINANCIAL EVALUATION FOR CY 2021', '3rd-quarter-target-financial-evaluation-for-cy-2021', '<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">3rd Quarter Target Financial Evaluation for CY 2021</span></span></p>', 'Zoom | Via Virtual platforms', '2021-09-21 09:30:00', '2021-09-21 17:00:00', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-e830-4967-a254-f2ea510b24b8', NULL, 'FREE Legal Consultation Online', 'free-legal-consultation-online', '<div class=\"c1et5uql cxmmr5t8 hcukyx3x ii04i59q kvgmc6g5 oygrvhab\">\n          <div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"auto\">Hear! Hear!</span></span></span></div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"c1et5uql cxmmr5t8 hcukyx3x ii04i59q o9v6fnle oygrvhab\">\n          <div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"auto\">In celebration of the Law Week, the <strong>Northeastern Mindanao State University (NEMSU)</strong> College of Law will conduct its first-ever<strong> FREE Legal Consultation Online </strong>on September 20, 22, and 24, 2021. </span></span></span></div>\n          \n          <div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"c1et5uql cxmmr5t8 hcukyx3x ii04i59q o9v6fnle oygrvhab\">\n          <div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"auto\">This initiative is open to all the seven (7) Campuses of NEMSU. ONLY the Faculty and Staff, who are currently employed, and Students, who are presently enrolled, of this University can avail of the free legal consultation.</span></span></span></div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"c1et5uql cxmmr5t8 hcukyx3x ii04i59q o9v6fnle oygrvhab\">\n          <div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"auto\">Please see posters for more details.</span></span></span></div>\n          \n          <div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"c1et5uql cxmmr5t8 hcukyx3x ii04i59q o9v6fnle oygrvhab\">\n          <div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"auto\">Thank you!</span></span></span></div>\n          \n          <div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</div>\n          <img alt=\"\" class=\"img img-responsive\" src=\"/public_files/images/law.jpg\" /></div>\n          \n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          \n          <p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Online | SDSSU-Tandag Campus', '2021-09-20 14:00:00', '2021-09-24 16:00:00', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-e92a-4914-83e5-2bd03af0f8a2', NULL, 'ISO INTERNAL AUDIT', 'iso-internal-audit', NULL, 'SDSSU-Tandag Campus', '2021-10-06 00:00:00', '2021-10-06 00:00:00', 1, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-e9e8-4956-a00f-e9a8dc283bc7', NULL, '2021 GFPS ON BOARDING AND 2022 GAD PLANNING AND BUDGETING', '2021-gfps-on-boarding-and-2022-gad-planning-and-budgeting', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">In the insterest of public service and in compliance to the mandates of this University and in response to RA No. 9710, CHED issued a memorandum which mandates SUCs to institutionalize the GAD plans and programs. On this end, the above-mentioned designees are instructed to attend the call-up for this purpose on October 13-25, 2021.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Meeting credentials for this purpose shall be dessimated by the Office of the GAD Director.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">Expenses incurred shall be charge to University Fund subject to the accounting and auditing rules and regulations.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\">For you guidance and compliance.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>', NULL, '2021-10-13 08:00:00', '2021-10-15 17:00:00', 0, 0, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-eaa1-485d-a816-df4019d80921', NULL, 'PRESENTATION OF NATIONAL EXPENDITURES PROGRAM FOR FY 2022', 'presentation-of-national-expenditures-program-for-fy-2022', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In the line with the 2022 Preparation of Budget Execution Documents to be submitted to the Department of Budget and Management, you are hereby instructed to attend this meeting on Wednesday, 9:30 AM, October 13, 2021 via online, SDSSU Tandag.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Expenses incurred shall be charged to local/campus funds subject to the accounting and auditing rules and regulations.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The meeting ID and password will be provided later.</span></span></p>\n          \n          <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">For your guidance and compliance</span></span></p>', 'SDSSU Tandag', '2021-10-13 09:30:00', '2021-10-13 17:00:00', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04'),
('987727b0-eb7b-4c8d-8acc-6968bbed1ea1', NULL, 'Calendar of Activities A.Y. 2022-2023', 'calendar-of-activities-ay-2022-2023', '<p><iframe frameborder=\"0\" height=\"1000px\" scrolling=\"yes\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TUYBhntrhaTmZuibiBa7LvcQuM6IQwe2/preview\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></p>', NULL, '2022-05-24 08:00:00', '2023-08-07 17:00:00', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:04', '2023-02-14 03:49:04');
