t-align:center\">Elementary School Graduate</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">None required</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">None required</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">None required</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Accountability, Customer Service Excellence, Emotional Maturity, Integrity, Stress Management, Teamwork, values and Ethics and Work Management</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Tandag City</td>\n                  </tr>\n              </tbody>\n          </table>\n          </div>\n          \n          <p>Interested and qualified applicants should signify their interest in writing. Attach the following documents to the application letter and send to the address below not later than July 10, 2019.</p>\n          \n          <ol>\n              <li>Fully accomplished Personal Data Sheet (PDS) with recent passport-sized picture (CS Form No. 212, Revised 2017) which can be downloaded at www.csc.gov.ph;</li>\n              <li>Performance rating in the last rating period (if applicable);</li>\n              <li>Photocopy of certificate of eligibility/rating/license; and</li>\n              <li>Photocopy of Transcript of Records.</li>\n          </ol>\n          \n          <p><strong>QUALIFIED APPLICANTS </strong>are advised to hand in or send through courier/email their application to:</p>\n          \n          <p><u>ROEL T. LIM</u></p>\n          \n          <p>AO-V/HRMO</p>\n          \n          <p>Rosario, Tandag City</p>\n          \n          <p>roelteveslim407@yahoo.com</p>\n          \n          <p><strong>APPLICATIONS WITH INCOMPLETE DOCUMENTS SHALL NOT BE ENTERTAINED.</strong></p>', '2019-07-01 02:49:14', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:11', '2023-02-14 03:49:11'),
('987727bb-288a-45d9-804a-fd5ed70d8aac', 'Medical Officer III', 'medical-officer-iii', '<table>\n              <tbody>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\">&nbsp;</td>\n                      <td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><strong>Qualification Standards</strong></td>\n                      <td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\">&nbsp;</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td><strong>Position Title</strong></td>\n                      <td><strong>Plantilla Item No.</strong></td>\n                      <td><strong>Salary<br />\n                      /Job/<br />\n                      Pay Grade</strong></td>\n                      <td><strong>Monthly<br />\n                      Salary</strong></td>\n                      <td><strong>Education</strong></td>\n                      <td><strong>Training</strong></td>\n                      <td><strong>Experience</strong></td>\n                      <td><strong>Eligibility</strong></td>\n                      <td><strong>Number of Vacancy</strong></td>\n                      <td><strong>Place of&nbsp;<br />\n                      Assignment</strong></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td>Medical Officer III</td>\n                      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n                      <td>21</td>\n                      <td>63,997.00</td>\n                      <td>Doctor of Medicine</td>\n                      <td>None Required</td>\n                      <td>Prreferably with full-time clinical practice experience Eligibility</td>\n                      <td>RA 1080(Physician)</td>\n                      <td>2</td>\n                      <td>NEMSU Birthing Clinic Tandag Campus</td>\n                  </tr>\n              </tbody>\n          </table>\n          \n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          \n          <p><strong>Job Summary</strong></p>\n          \n          <ol>\n              <li>Maintain promote and protects the physical and mental well-being of learners;</li>\n              <li>Planning strategies for health related programs;</li>\n              <li>Provide supervisory functions to health personnel;</li>\n              <li>Conduct and monitor health related program;</li>\n              <li>Establish sustainable linkages to educational partners and stakeholder;</li>\n              <li>Use a diverse and current teaching approaches in the classroom and for practice experience including laboratory, simulation, and stakeholders;</li>\n              <li>Do other task as may be assigned by the higher authorities.</li>\n          </ol>\n          \n          <p>Interested and qualified applicants may submit their job application at NEMSU HR Office - Tandag Campus with the following documents on or before <strong>January 20, 2023</strong>.</p>\n          \n          <ol>\n              <li>Letter Intent addressed to:</li>\n          </ol>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;NEMESIO G. LOAYON, PhD</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;SUC President III&nbsp;</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; North Eastern Mindanao State University</strong></p>\n          \n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Thru:</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ROEL T. LIM, JD, MPA</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;AO V/ HRMO III</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;North Eastern Mindanao State University</strong></p>\n          \n          <ol>\n              <li>Notarized Personal Data Sheet with passport size ID picture (Civil Service Form No. 212, Revised 2017 with Work Experience Sheet).</li>\n              <li>Transcript of Records, and Diploma</li>\n              <li>Copy of duly signed Individual Performance Commitment Review (IPCR) Accomplishment/Performance Evaluation (if applicable).</li>\n              <li>Certificate of Training &amp; Seminar attended (if applicable).</li>\n              <li>Certified true copy of Certificate of Eligibility</li>\n              <li>Certificate of Employment &amp; Service Record (if applicable).</li>\n          </ol>', '2023-06-15 06:07:07', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:11', '2023-02-14 03:49:11'),
