TS SHALL NOT BE ENTERTAINED.</strong></p>', '2022-04-13 15:20:26', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:11', '2023-02-14 03:49:11'),
('987727bb-5064-42ba-a939-b76b375445cb', 'Administrative Officer II (Public Relations Officer II)', 'administrative-officer-ii-public-relations-officer-ii', '<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n              <tbody>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\">&nbsp;</td>\n                      <td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Qualification Standards</strong></td>\n                      <td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Position Title</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Plantilla Item No.</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Salary<br />\n                      /Job/<br />\n                      Pay Grade</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Monthly<br />\n                      Salary</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Education</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Training</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Experience</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Eligibility</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Number of Vacancy</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Place of&nbsp;<br />\n                      Assignment</strong></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Administrative Officer II</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">11</td>\n                      <td>27,000.00</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Bachelor&#39;s degree relevant to the job</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">None Required</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">None Required</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">CSC Professional/ Second Level Eligibility</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n                      <td>\n                      <p style=\"text-align:center\">NEMSU Birthing Clinic Tandag Campus</p>\n                      </td>\n                  </tr>\n              </tbody>\n          </table>\n          \n          <p><strong>Job Summary</strong></p>\n          \n          <ol>\n              <li>Plan public relations communication strategies that will maintain in a positive public image of the University;</li>\n              <li>Build positive relationship with stakeholders, media and the public;</li>\n              <li>Responsible for all communications, public relations of the University;</li>\n              <li>Respond to public events and inquiries;</li>\n              <li>Write memorandum, reports and prepare proposals;</li>\n              <li>Do other taskas may be assigned by Immediate Supervisor.</li>\n          </ol>\n          \n          <p>Interested and qualified applicants may submit their job application at NEMSU HR Office - Tandag Campus with the following documents on or before <strong>January 20, 2023</strong>.</p>\n          \n          <ol>\n              <li>Letter Intent addressed to:</li>\n          </ol>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;NEMESIO G. LOAYON, PhD</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;SUC President III&nbsp;</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; North Eastern Mindanao State University</strong></p>\n          \n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Thru:</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ROEL T. LIM, JD, MPA</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;AO V/ HRMO III</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;North Eastern Mindanao State University</strong></p>\n          \n          <ol>\n              <li>Notarized Personal Data Sheet with passport size ID picture (Civil Service Form No. 212, Revised 2017 with Work Experience Sheet).</li>\n              <li>Transcript of Records, and Diploma</li>\n              <li>Copy of duly signed Individual Performance Commitment Review (IPCR) Accomplishment/Performance Evaluation (if applicable).</li>\n              <li>Certificate of Training &amp; Seminar attended (if applicable).</li>\n              <li>Certified true copy of Certificate of Eligibility</li>\n              <li>Certificate of Employment &amp; Service Record (if applicable).</li>\n          </ol>', '2023-06-15 06:07:39', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:11', '2023-02-14 03:49:11'),
('987727bb-54d5-42dc-84ed-5a909f89d5a7', 'School Librarian III', 'school-librarian-iii', '<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n              <tbody>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\">&nbsp;</td>\n                      <td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Qualification Standards</strong></td>\n                      <td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Position Title</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Plantilla Item No.</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Salary<br />\n                      /Job/<br />\n                      Pay Grade</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Monthly<br />\n                      Salary</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Education</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Training</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Experience</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Eligibility</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Competency<br />\n                      (if applicable)</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Place of&nbsp;<br />\n                      Assignment</strong></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">SCHOOL LIBRARIAN III</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">SDSPSCB-SL3-1-1999</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">13</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">25, 232</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Bachelor&#39;s degree in Library Science or Information Science or Bachelor of Science in Educaton/Arts major in Library Science</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">None required</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">None required</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">RA 1080</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Accountability, Customer Service Excellence, Building Partnership and Linkage, Emotional Maturity, Safety and Risk Management, Innovative Thinking, Integrity,&nbsp; Stress Management, Teamwork, values and Ethics and Work Management</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Tandag City</td>\n                  </tr>\n              </tbody>\n          </table>\n          </div>\n          \n          <p>Interested and qualified applicants should signify their interest in writing. Attach the following documents to the application letter and send to the address below not later than July 10, 2019.</p>\n          \n          <ol>\n              <li>Fully accomplished Personal Data Sheet (PDS) with recent passport-sized picture (CS Form No. 212, Revised 2017) which can be downloaded at www.csc.gov.ph;</li>\n              <li>Performance rating in the last rating period (if applicable);</li>\n              <li>Photocopy of certificate of eligibility/rating/license; and</li>\n              <li>Photocopy of Transcript of Records.</li>\n          </ol>\n          \n          <p><strong>QUALIFIED APPLICANTS </strong>are advised to hand in or send through courier/email their application to:</p>\n          \n          <p><u>ROEL T. LIM</u></p>\n          \n          <p>AO-V/HRMO</p>\n          \n          <p>Rosario, Tandag City</p>\n          \n          <p>roelteveslim407@yahoo.com</p>\n          \n          <p><strong>APPLICATIONS WITH INCOMPLETE DOCUMENTS SHALL NOT BE ENTERTAINED.</strong></p>', '2019-07-01 03:09:38', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:11', '2023-02-14 03:49:11'),
('987727bb-55bc-4b3c-b874-4aaca508912a', 'Administrative Officer I (Supply Officer I)', 'administrative-officer-i-supply-officer-i', '<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n              <tbody>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\">&nbsp;</td>\n                      <td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Qualification Standards</strong></td>\n                      <td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Position Title</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Plantilla Item No.</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Salary<br />\n                      /Job/<br />\n                      Pay Grade</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Monthly<br />\n                      Salary</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Education</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Training</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Experience</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Eligibility</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Competency<br />\n                      (if applicable)</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Place of&nbsp;<br />\n                      Assignment</strong></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Administrative Officer I (Supply Officer I)</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">SDSPSCB-AO1-10-2004</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">10</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">19, 233</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Bachelors Degree in Commerce / Business Administration major in Accounting</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">4 Hours relevant training</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">1 year relevant experience</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Career Service (Professional) Second Level Eligibility</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Accountability, Customer Service Excellence, Building Partnership and Linkage, Environmental Awareness, Commitment to Learning, Communicative, Emotional Maturity,Health, Safety and Risk Management, People First, Stewardship of Resources,&nbsp; Integrity, Stress Management, Teamwork, values and Ethics and Work Management.</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Cagwait Campus</td>\n                  </tr>\n              </tbody>\n          </table>\n          </div>\n          \n          <p>Interested and qualified applicants should signify their interest in writing. Attach the following documents to the application letter and send to the address below not later than February 7, 2020.</p>\n          \n          <ol>\n              <li>Fully accomplished Personal Data Sheet (PDS) with recent passport-sized picture (CS Form No. 212, Revised 2017) which can be downloaded at www.csc.gov.ph;</li>\n              <li>Performance rating in the last rating period (if applicable);</li>\n              <li>Photocopy of certificate of eligibility/rating/license; and</li>\n              <li>Photocopy of Transcript of Records.</li>\n          </ol>\n          \n          <p><strong>QUALIFIED APPLICANTS </strong>are advised to hand in or send through courier/email their application to:</p>\n          \n          <p><u>ROEL T. LIM</u></p>\n          \n          <p>AO-V/HRMO</p>\n          \n          <p>Rosario, Tandag City</p>\n          \n          <p>roelteveslim407@yahoo.com</p>\n          \n          <p><strong>APPLICATIONS WITH INCOMPLETE DOCUMENTS SHALL NOT BE ENTERTAINED.</strong></p>', '2020-01-31 08:50:13', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:11', '2023-02-14 03:49:11'),
('987727bb-5711-4127-a729-9957c1111118', 'Registrar III', 'registrar-iii', '<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n              <tbody>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\">&nbsp;</td>\n                      <td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Qualification Standards</strong></td>\n                      <td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Position Title</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Plantilla Item No.</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Salary<br />\n                      /Job/<br />\n                      Pay Grade</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Monthly<br />\n                      Salary</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Education</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Training</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Experience</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Eligibility</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Competency<br />\n                      (if applicable)</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Place of&nbsp;<br />\n                      Assignment</strong></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Registrar III</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">SDSPSCB-R3-1-1999</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">18</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">45,203.00</td>\n                      <td style=\"tex