INCOMPLETE DOCUMENTS SHALL NOT BE ENTERTAINED.</strong></p>', '2021-02-09 05:45:20', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:11', '2023-02-14 03:49:11'),
('987727bb-6b4e-4cb9-ab14-20cee8b4c0d3', 'Nurse II', 'nurse-ii', '<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n              <tbody>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\">&nbsp;</td>\n                      <td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Qualification Standards</strong></td>\n                      <td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Position Title</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Plantilla Item No.</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Salary<br />\n                      /Job/<br />\n                      Pay Grade</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Monthly<br />\n                      Salary</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Education</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Training</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Experience</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Eligibility</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Number of Vacancy</strong></td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Place of&nbsp;<br />\n                      Assignment</strong></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Nurse II</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">16</td>\n                      <td>39,672.00</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">Bachelor of Science in Nursing</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">4 hours of relevant training</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">1 year of relevant experience&nbsp;</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">RA 1080 (Nurse)</td>\n                      <td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n                      <td>\n                      <p style=\"text-align:center\">NEMSU San Miguel&nbsp;Campus</p>\n                      </td>\n                  </tr>\n              </tbody>\n          </table>\n          \n          <p><strong>Job Summary</strong></p>\n          \n          <ol>\n              <li>Performs basic physical examination and other basic nursing care procedures;</li>\n              <li>Assist School Physician/Dentist during consultation;</li>\n              <li>Provide avaible medicine to students/ employees with minor ailments;</li>\n              <li>Give advise and guidance concerning health and sanitation;</li>\n              <li>Blood pressure taking, dressing of wounds and treat minor ailments;</li>\n              <li>Do other task as may be assigned by Immediate Supervisor.</li>\n          </ol>\n          \n          <p>Interested and qualified applicants may submit their job application at NEMSU HR Office - Tandag Campus with the following documents on or before <strong>January 20, 2023</strong>.</p>\n          \n          <ol>\n              <li>Letter Intent addressed to:</li>\n          </ol>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;NEMESIO G. LOAYON, PhD</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;SUC President III&nbsp;</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; North Eastern Mindanao State University</strong></p>\n          \n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Thru:</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ROEL T. LIM, JD, MPA</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;AO V/ HRMO III</strong></p>\n          \n          <p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;North Eastern Mindanao State University</strong></p>\n          \n          <ol>\n              <li>Notarized Personal Data Sheet with passport size ID picture (Civil Service Form No. 212, Revised 2017 with Work Experience Sheet).</li>\n              <li>Transcript of Records, and Diploma</li>\n              <li>Copy of duly signed Individual Performance Commitment Review (IPCR) Accomplishment/Performance Evaluation (if applicable).</li>\n              <li>Certificate of Training &amp; Seminar attended (if applicable).</li>\n              <li>Certified true copy of Certificate of Eligibility</li>\n              <li>Certificate of Employment &amp; Service Record (if applicable).</li>\n          </ol>', '2023-06-15 05:56:58', 0, 1, '2023-02-14 03:49:11', '2023-02-14 03:49:11'),
